// push takes any receiver at compile time (unknown parameters, like print and
// ord, DEC-019) and rejects a non-array at RUNTIME with the VM's type_name —
// the guard a program that smuggles an int past the checker hits, worded
// identically by the seed VM, the C backend, the zig VM and LLVM.
// EXPECT-RUNTIME-ERROR: push expects an array, got int
fn main() {
    print(push(42, 1))
}
